  "label": "Racist Stereotype: White People Own Many Pets as Substitute for Human Ownership",
  "description": "This stereotype falsely implies that white people own pets because they are not allowed to own human beings, which is a racially charged and offensive trope rooted in historical racism and dehumanization. It is not based on any factual or logical premise but is used to demean and stereotype a racial group by invoking a false historical analogy.",
